ional available function, not itself a compulsory filing route.\",\"family\":\"scope\",\"formalization\":{\"facts\":[{\"meaning\":\"The selected filing is an application or submission of an investment product administered by IPD.\",\"name\":\"covered_ipd_filing\",\"requires_judgment\":true,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"u1\",\"u9\",\"u17\"],\"type\":\"bool\",\"unit\":\"Boolean\"},{\"meaning\":\"The filing date is on or after the compulsory transition date.\",\"name\":\"filing_on_or_after_2024_11_30\",\"requires_judgment\":false,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"u1\",\"u9\"],\"type\":\"bool\",\"unit\":\"Boolean\"},{\"meaning\":\"The covered filing was submitted through e-IP.\",\"name\":\"submitted_via_e_ip\",\"requires_judgment\":true,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"u1\",\"u9\"],\"type\":\"bool\",\"unit\":\"Boolean\"}],\"result\":\"(if (and covered_ipd_filing filing_on_or_after_2024_11_30) submitted_via_e_ip false)\",\"result_type\":\"bool\",\"scope\":\"Selected control: compulsory e-IP submission route for covered IPD applications and submissions.\"},\"local_id\":\"r1\",\"questions\":[\"The source does not specify whether a filing initiated before 30 November but completed afterward is governed by the new route.\"],\"statement\":\"From 30 November 2024, covered IPD applications and submissions must use e-IP; existing channels are accepted during the parallel run ending 29 November 2024.\",\"subject\":\"Compulsory e-IP submission route\"},{\"assumptions\":[\"“After the extended period” is read as beginning immediately after 29 November 2024.\",\"The word “must” applies to applications and submissions, while the listed integrated requests clarify examples rather than limit the duty.\",\"The source does not expressly state whether any legacy channel remains available by IPD discretion.\"],\"citations\":[{\"quote\":\"To facilitate these enhancements, the SFC will extend the parallel run period of e-IP by one month to 29 November 2024.\",\"unit_id\":\"u7\"},{\"quote\":\"Starting 30 November 2024, i